Hi

  Version 2.7 of twclock has just been release and can be found at
http://wa0eir.ham.org  This version fixes a nasty little memory leak.  
There are also two new buttons for on line Help and About.
        
  Twclock will displays local, GMT, and the time in major cities around
the world.  It also has an alarm and ID timer.  The alarm can be set to
beep,
flash, and/or send your call in CW via the soundcard.  Just hook the
sound 
card to your rig for an automatic CW ID.
